1. Install Docker Desktop
2. Check it works
docker --version
docker run hello-world
3. Put files in one folder : Dockerfile, nginx.conf and techbook.html
4. Build the image
cd portfolio-book
docker build -t portfolio-tech-book .
5. supriyajois@Supriyas-Laptop-170 portfolio-tech-book % docker build -t portfolio-tech-book .       
6. supriyajois@Supriyas-Laptop-170 portfolio-tech-book % docker run -d -p 8080:80 portfolio-tech-book
7. Check what is running (it has a random name charming_lewin here)
supriyajois@Supriyas-Laptop-170 portfolio-tech-book % docker ps
CONTAINER ID   IMAGE                 COMMAND                  CREATED         STATUS         PORTS                                     NAMES
eaa3f510b9b0   portfolio-tech-book   "/docker-entrypoint.…"   6 minutes ago   Up 6 minutes   0.0.0.0:8080->80/tcp, [::]:8080->80/tcp   charming_lewin

8. Stop it
supriyajois@Supriyas-Laptop-170 portfolio-tech-book % docker stop charming_lewin
charming_lewin

